### AI Agents ###
# Ignore the agent customization root, but track the permission rules so they
# travel with the repo into per-issue worktrees (agy reads .agents/settings.json).
.agents/*
!.agents/settings.json

# Per-run scratch written into an agy worktree (task brief, run result, review notes).
